      "type": "editorial-text",
      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "Atelier",
        "heading": "SHAPED WITH CARE",
        "text": "<p>The Vivienne is a study in texture and proportion.</p><p>Soft leather, a braided edge, and warm gold fittings come together in a silhouette that feels entirely its own.</p><p>Our bestselling top handle bag, with a quiet presence that carries through the day.</p>",
        "label": "Discover The Vivienne",
        "link": "/products/velantra-vivienne"
      }
