    "main": {
      "type": "main-product",
      "settings": {
        "title_override": "CAMILLE",
        "description_override": "<p>The Camille is made for a day that takes the scenic route. Sturdy canvas, contrasting trim and a familiar boat-tote silhouette feel at home at the market, by the water or beside your desk. Easy to dress around and full of character, it is the bag that becomes part of your routine.</p><p>The canvas weave remains part of the design, framed by long handles, vertical front bands and a defined base. A slim belt and small gold-tone fitting bring a more dressed touch to its practical shape. Two-tone and solid colors each retain their own construction details.</p>",
