          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Details",
            "content": "<p>The Camille pairs an open-top canvas body with long handles, front bands and a belted detail. Approximate dimensions are 20 × 14 × 8 inches (W × H × D), with an approximately 10-inch handle drop. Construction varies between two-tone and solid colorways.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "tab_care": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Care",
            "content": "<p>Spot-clean the canvas with a soft, barely damp cloth and mild soap where needed. Avoid soaking the trim or hardware. Air-dry fully away from direct heat and store upright in a cool, dry place.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
