      "settings": {
        "title_override": "DELPHINE",
        "description_override": "<p>The Delphine moves easily from the first coffee to the last table of the evening. Textured canvas and burnished leather give its compact shape a warm, collected character, while rolled handles and gold-tone fittings lend a little formality. A bag for the woman whose plans rarely end where they began.</p><p>Substantial diagonal canvas twill meets smooth leather at the flap, side gussets and curved corners. The change in texture gives the compact silhouette its depth, while visible stitching traces the handles and edges with a clear, deliberate line.</p>",
