{
  "sections": {
    "main": {
      "type": "main-product",
      "settings": {
        "title_override": "VIVIENNE",
        "description_override": "<p>For the woman who leaves room for the unexpected. The Vivienne pairs a softly slouching leather body with rolled handles, a braided upper edge and warm gold accents. Its relaxed folds bring an easy warmth to a tailored coat, a familiar pair of jeans, and whatever the afternoon becomes.</p><p>Vegetable-tanned leather gives the Vivienne its tactile character. Look closely at the grain, the smoother trim and the stitching that follows each curve: the interest lies in how the surfaces meet, with enough softness for the silhouette to settle naturally.</p>",
        "fact_material": "Vegetable-tanned leather",
        "fact_detail": "Made by artisans with 10 years of experience",
        "preorder_lead_time": "10 days before dispatch",
        "show_facts": true,
        "show_policies": false,
        "show_shipping_summary": false,
        "fact_carry": "10 days before dispatch",
        "lead_time": "10 days before dispatch"
      },
      "blocks": {
        "tab_details": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Details",
            "content": "<p>Two rolled top handles sit above a softly folded body, with a braided upper edge, inward-falling belt details and warm gold-tone fittings. The approximate dimensions are 38 × 27 × 20 cm (W × H × D).</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "tab_care": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Care",
            "content": "<p>Wipe the leather with a soft, dry cloth. Keep it away from prolonged moisture, direct heat and sunlight, and store it loosely filled to support its shape.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "tab_shipping": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Shipping & delivery",
            "content": "<p>Please allow 10 days from your order to dispatch. Delivery time is additional and varies by destination. You will receive tracking details when your order ships. See our <a href=\"/policies/shipping-policy\">shipping policy</a> for delivery information.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "tab_returns": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Returns",
            "content": "<p>Returns are accepted within 30 days of delivery for unused items in their original packaging with tags attached. To arrange a return, contact <a href=\"mailto:customerservice@velantrafashion.com\">customerservice@velantrafashion.com</a>. See our <a href=\"/policies/refund-policy\">return policy</a> for full conditions.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "tab_details",
